///
/// When a message is unarchived the new messages replace the original message in the
/// batch. Messages that are selected but fail to unarchive (invalid format) will remain
/// unchanged in the message batch but will be flagged as having failed, allowing you to
/// [error handle them](/docs/configuration/error_handling).
///
/// ## Metadata
///
/// The metadata found on the messages handled by this processor will be copied into the
/// resulting messages. For the unarchive formats that contain file information (tar,
/// zip), a metadata field is also added to each message called `archive_filename` with
/// the extracted filename.
///
/// Status: stable
